{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>56歲的前TVB四大花旦之一郭可盈，與林文龍結婚後淡出幕前，專心相夫教女。兩人育有一名16歲的女兒林天若，一家三口不時周遊列國，享受人生。郭可盈近日舉家飛往泰國曼谷度假，除了一家人到LV掃貨外，林天若長得亭亭玉立，遺傳父母美貌。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭可盈是一位靚太。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250325/981298057045872640310548.jpeg/qqjOUWUQmraQbBlyz39v-Iltd2o2rRB9dfrGqXX6xqk\"/><figcaption>郭可盈是一位靚太。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭可盈選完港姐第一部電視劇，就是和陶大宇合作《Catwalk俏佳人》\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250331/983349984017911808931247.jpeg/EqJs1AoiqeMi-9LNxJ-KQ7t2kmxzjVS3s1Mv1LNTL9Q\"/><figcaption>郭可盈選完港姐第一部電視劇，就是和陶大宇合作《Catwalk俏佳人》</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林放龍和郭可盈的女兒林天若。（IG@tanialam_ty）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250420/990634263105900544349150.jpeg/vtuqulxlRe02FhIaQ2WCegWGofD2_rZvgXZ3YoF2d2I\"/><figcaption>林放龍和郭可盈的女兒林天若。（IG@tanialam_ty）</figcaption></figure><p>郭可盈林文龍遊曼谷幫襯LV</p><p>郭可盈日前在Instagram分享多張與林文龍和女兒到曼谷度假的照片及影片。16歲的林天若穿上帶有些少性感的上衣，尖尖瓜子臉，與媽媽一樣靚女又有氣質。一家人在餐廳歎美食之餘，又上四季酒店專屬的遊艇上遊船河睇夜景，拍下多張美照。既然來到曼谷，掃貨當然是必到行程。郭可盈與林文龍和女兒到LV門市，店員殷勤招呼，向林文龍送上一個LV tote bag，郭可盈連連多謝，又拍下LV門市外部，玩得十分開心。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭可盈林文龍一家人到曼谷旅行。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496964806152192695284.png/hhdxFiN7CokBAyMm_HsAaDMDrxQNgheXP3as6z92rOs\"/><figcaption>郭可盈林文龍一家人到曼谷旅行。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林文龍獲LV tote bag一個。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496962100695040450918.png/u5p7z_fsl9ofwb_nXmIPGFz_rwm9ak1WLJEkfCyRJHw\"/><figcaption>林文龍獲LV tote bag一個。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"行LV。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496959265214464254083.png/csfku7zTyk-VuFxiHybbqCw-VGqFSy-yWOFvuljhb7o\"/><figcaption>行LV。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遊船河。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496987854114816235469.png/eUOBAmhZsYI9IXCwEFfPgZY5KPY3OO0fU6Dy61Og8us\"/><figcaption>遊船河。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遊船河。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163497995459629056817306.png/Kv4eKJgF0zsnh59QWWnqZiOAFykkPEdA3C3I2dwtyNk\"/><figcaption>遊船河。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"浪漫！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496985471619072504198.png/XcczqcT6iYpz-gWQ2wz2zmzv7M82RCo0YXz5jmF8-Y4\"/><figcaption>浪漫！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"浪漫！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496982954905600283401.png/-gytEPsuwjIvgwSp5Apte1q-8aNfsjmosI5OOLCOTjg\"/><figcaption>浪漫！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恩愛！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496980295585792837625.png/h9N9sph4pFeb1o0dmpwBSEDnDU1pVnc7VdiJj1XYiY8\"/><figcaption>恩愛！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夜景。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496977451716608068975.png/3z9IXzPwKODVdSZf4a07khYtWRo2gQspuxJbq7sSW6s\"/><figcaption>夜景。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人結婚多年都好恩愛！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496990114844672463715.png/jHurWoqZkL90ThVp6jATdGS89YvB6l9MvIDYuLyA2Lg\"/><figcaption>兩人結婚多年都好恩愛！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林天若長得亭亭玉立。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496987568771072761349.png/zxCVvgJqGf1lU3AGERJXnVZHqAB38bLnDWOeDg1jng4\"/><figcaption>林天若長得亭亭玉立。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496985005920256473268.png/6M376RDSCc6b2g42cWi6Q1r-1T0yO9MYjBpdrYwaXa0\"/><figcaption>靚！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚！（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496982409515008280946.png/j4FPzVg8p6A8l8X_aI_r6uMLhvflcr_IZB7Dn2Qew58\"/><figcaption>靚！（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"做運動。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260810/1163496979842469888485123.png/aA1T7_yACWv1oWr3Z8R58KJkIhHMTeje-y06nfstOp0\"/><figcaption>做運動。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T13:20:28.681141+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":747,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}